msgstr "雅致的纪念碑"

#. MoreRoomTypes.STRINGS.ROOMS.CRITERIA.GRAVE.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "MoreRoomTypes.STRINGS.ROOMS.CRITERIA.GRAVE.DESCRIPTION"
