msgstr "饮水机"

#. MoreRoomTypes.STRINGS.ROOMS.CRITERIA.WATERCOOLER.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "MoreRoomTypes.STRINGS.ROOMS.CRITERIA.WATERCOOLER.DESCRIPTION"
